<title>USA: Varian to buy back up to five mln shares.</title>
<headline>Varian to buy back up to five mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Varian Associates Inc. Friday said its board of directors approved the purchase of up to five million additional shares of the company's stock.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the stock buy-back extends an ongoing program and replaces a four million share repurchase approved in 1994, which has essentially been completed.</p>
<p>The company also declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.08 a share, payable Jan. 20, 1997 to shareholders of record on Dec. 6.</p>
<p>Varian shares were up 3/8 at 49 in midafternoon trade.</p>
